al look and as you can see here it  actually looks pretty cool now keep in  mind that this is going to be designed  by riri williams herself so she doesn't  have access at least not at first to all  of the equipment and materials that tony  stark had when making his iron man suit  except for his first suit in which riri  williams's iron heart suit is kind of  going to resemble the mark 1 iron man  the one that he made in a cave and why  is that well that was iron man's first  suit that he made and this is riri  williams's first suit that she makes now  this is actually quite different than  the iron heart armor model 1 that she  makes in the comics for the very first  time but of course it is the mcu and  this is actually a little bit more  realistic the one that we're seeing here  in the movie however keep in mind and  we've seen this in the trailer she is  going to get materials from wakanda  we've seen her in wakanda we've seen her  in shuri's lab and we've seen her  actually making the iron heart armor so  i think it's safe to say that this is  just her first suit and is definitely  not going to be the final suit that we  see her in in black panther wakanda  forever now there have been some leaked  photos of the iron heart suit that is  going to be in the iron heart series and  possibly and probably in black panther  wakanda forever i can't show them due to  copyright reasons i'll get this video  taken down but essentially they confirm  that this suit that she has is going to  change over time but of course we knew  that riri williams is a genius and she  bases her iron heart armors off of iron  man armors and iron man armors have  always evolved and grown and changed and  it's no different for riri she's always  going to be thinking of new ideas for  her iron heart armor so it'll  consistently change now we do have some  art for other characters as well most of  these we have already seen in the  trailer but here are some great looks at  some of the characters 